@startuml
title Appendix — One Stage-3 contract, three explicit synthesis backends
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 225

rectangle "Bounded\nAnalysisEvidenceEnvelope" as input
rectangle "Typed selector\nspecgraph.analysis.backend\ndeterministic | openai | local" as selection
rectangle "AnalysisModelPort" as port
rectangle "Deterministic\noffline fixed rule\nexternalTransmission=false" as deterministic
cloud "OpenAI\nshared grounded prompt\nexternalTransmission=true" as openai
rectangle "LM Studio / llama.cpp\nOpenAI-compatible local endpoint\nexternalTransmission=false" as local
rectangle "AnalysisResult\n+ AnalysisModelProvenance" as result
rectangle "Schema + grounding\nreference validation" as validation
database "Persisted advisory\nanalysis history" as history

input --> port
selection --> port
port --> deterministic
port --> openai
port --> local
deterministic --> result
openai --> result
local --> result
result --> validation
validation --> history

note bottom of selection
Deterministic is the safe default.
Unknown, mismatched or unavailable selections fail.
Stage-1 selection is independent.
end note

note bottom of local
Selected local endpoint must be a
loopback/private IP literal.
Public addresses and hostnames are rejected.
end note

note bottom of history
Same project-owned input/output shape
does not imply equal model quality.
No calibrated AML claim.
end note
@enduml
